85 N9       "        +112          5500 to 3400          +3 2/3        " 
85 B        "        +131          5500 to 3200          +  2/3        "  
 
 
 
 

KAART 006
FILMCAN WEIGHTS
 
 
 35 mm:      400ft/122m   = 1   kg  /  2 lb 3   oz
            1000ft/305m   = 2,5 kg  /  5 lb 8   oz
 
 16 mm:      100ft/ 30m   = 0,2 kg  /  3,25     oz
             400ft/122m   = 0,5 kg  /  1 lb 1,5 oz
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 

